    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Neonatal Resuscitation Programme (NRP) is mandatory for all healthcare providers involved with newborn and neonatal care. CIME in collaboration with the Department of Paediatrics and Child Health organised NRP to improve the competence and performance of NICU staff.",
